                                "sense_id": "8f005fe7-273a-3b01-9090-e2548a210400",
                                "text": "If the mixture is too dry to incorporate all the flour, a bit at a time, stir in just enough more ice water to blend the ingredients; don't overmoisten, as the dough should be stiff."
